{"id":"wb-7-1232","name":"武冈城墙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"武冈城墙","text":"武冈城墙，位于中国湖南省武冈市。武冈城墙全长5874米，现存1450米（内城、外城各存两段）。1961年，武冈城墙公布为武冈文物保护单位；2006年，公布为湖南省文物保护单位；2013年5月，公布为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%AD%A6%E5%86%88%E5%9F%8E%E5%A2%99","revisionId":86476200,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86476200","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/04004160553444c5cc0b1024.jpg","title":"Wugang1131.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Wugang1131.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1e/Wugang1131.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"FreeePedia","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Wugang","width":320,"height":240}}